#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:8
msgid "Built-in Types"
msgstr "Vstavene typy"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:10
msgid ""
"The following sections describe the standard types that are built into the "
"interpreter."
msgstr ""
"Nasledujici sekce popisuji standardni typy, ktere jsou vstaveny do "
"interpretu."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:15
msgid ""
"The principal built-in types are numerics, sequences, mappings, classes, "
"instances and exceptions."
msgstr ""
"Hlavni vstavene typy jsou numerika, sekvence, mapovani, tridy, instance a "
"vyjimky."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:18
msgid ""
"Some collection classes are mutable.  The methods that add, subtract, or "
"rearrange their members in place, and don't return a specific item, never "
"return the collection instance itself but ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Nektere kolekce tridy jsou mutabilni. Metody, ktere pridavaji, odcitaji nebo"
" zmenovavaji sve cleny na miste a nevraci specifickou polozku, nikdy nevraci"
" samu instanci kolekce, ale ``None``."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:22
msgid ""
"Some operations are supported by several object types; in particular, "
"practically all objects can be compared for equality, tested for truth "
"value, and converted to a string (with the :func:`repr` function or the "
"slightly different :func:`str` function).  The latter function is implicitly"
" used when an object is written by the :func:`print` function."
msgstr ""
"Nektere operace jsou podporovany nekterymi typy objektu; zvlaste prakticky "
"vsechny objekty mohou byt porovnany pro rovnost, testovany pro pravdivosnt, "
"a konvertovany na retezec (s funkcei :func:`repr` nebo slinit odlisnou "
":func:`str` funkci). Posledne funkce je implicitne pouzita, kdyz je objekt "
"zapsane :func:`print` funkcej."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:32
msgid "Truth Value Testing"
msgstr "Testovani pravdivosti"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:41
msgid ""
"Any object can be tested for truth value, for use in an :keyword:`if` or "
":keyword:`while` condition or as operand of the Boolean operations below."
msgstr ""
"Libovolny objekt muze byt testovan na pravdivost, pro pouziti v "
":keyword:`if` nebo :keyword:`while` stavu nebo jako operand booleovskych "
"operaci nize."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:46
msgid ""
"By default, an object is considered true unless its class defines either a "
":meth:`~object.__bool__` method that returns ``False`` or a "
":meth:`~object.__len__` method that returns zero, when called with the "
"object. [1]_ If one of the methods raises an exception when called, the "
"exception is propagated and the object does not have a truth value (for "
"example, :data:`NotImplemented`). Here are most of the built-in objects "
"considered false:"
msgstr ""
"Ve vychozi, objekt je pouzivane pravdivy pokud jeho trida definuje bud "
":meth:`~object.__bool__` metoda, ktera vraci ``False`` nebo "
":meth:`~object.__len__` metoda, ktera vraci nula, kdyz je nazvan s objektem."
" [1]_ Pokud jedna z metod vyvolava vyjimku pri volani, vyjimka se siri a "
"objekt nema pravdivost (napriklaz :data:`NotImplemented`). Zde jsou vetsina "
"vstavene objekty pouzivane false:"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:58
msgid "constants defined to be false: ``None`` and ``False``"
msgstr "konstakty definovane jako false: ``None`` a ``False``"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:60
msgid ""
"zero of any numeric type: ``0``, ``0.0``, ``0j``, ``Decimal(0)``, "
"``Fraction(0, 1)``"
msgstr ""
"nula jakehokoli numerickeho typu: ``0``, ``0.0``, ``0j``, ``Decimal(0)``, "
"``Fraction(0, 1)``"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"empty sequences and collections: ``''``, ``()``, ``[]``, ``{}``, ``set()``, "
"``range(0)``"
msgstr ""
"prázdné sekvence a kolekce: ``''``, ``()``, ``[]``, ``{}``, ``set()``, "
"``range(0)``"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:72
msgid ""
"Operations and built-in functions that have a Boolean result always return "
"``0`` or ``False`` for false and ``1`` or ``True`` for true, unless "
"otherwise stated. (Important exception: the Boolean operations ``or`` and "
"``and`` always return one of their operands.)"
msgstr ""
"Operace a vestavěné funkce, které mají logický výsledek, vždy vracejí ``0`` "
"nebo ``False`` pro nepravdu a ``1`` nebo ``True`` pro pravdu, pokud není "
"uvedeno jinak. (Důležitá výjimka: logické operace ``or`` a ``and`` vždy "
"vracejí jeden ze svých operandů.)"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:81
msgid ""
"Boolean Operations --- :keyword:`!and`, :keyword:`!or`, :keyword:`!not`"
msgstr "Logické operace --- :keyword:`!and`, :keyword:`!or`, :keyword:`!not`"

