#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:331
msgid ""
"Also referred to as integer division.  For operands of type :class:`int`, "
"the result has type :class:`int`.  For operands of type :class:`float`, the "
"result has type :class:`float`.  In general, the result is a whole integer, "
"though the result's type is not necessarily :class:`int`.  The result is "
"always rounded towards minus infinity: ``1//2`` is ``0``, ``(-1)//2`` is "
"``-1``, ``1//(-2)`` is ``-1``, and ``(-1)//(-2)`` is ``0``."
msgstr ""
"Takee se nazyvá celocíslelne dělení. Pro operandy typu :class:`int` má "
"výsledek typ :class:`int`. Pro operandy typu :class:`float` má výsledek typ "
":class:`float`. Obecne je výsledkem cele císlo, prestože typ výsledku neni "
"nutne :class:`int`. Výsledek je vzdy zaokrouhlen k zápornému nekonecnu: "
"``1//2`` je ``0``, ``(-1)//2`` je ``-1``, ``1//(-2)`` je ``-1`` a "
"``(-1)//(-2)`` je ``0``."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:339
msgid ""
"Not for complex numbers.  Instead convert to floats using :func:`abs` if "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Ne pro komplexní cisla. Místo toho pouzijte :func:`abs` pro konverzi na "
"float, pokud je to vhodne."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:350
msgid ""
"Conversion from :class:`float` to :class:`int` truncates, discarding the "
"fractional part. See functions :func:`math.floor` and :func:`math.ceil` for "
"alternative conversions."
msgstr ""
"Konverze z :class:`float` na :class:`int` odsekne zlomkovou cast. Podvejte "
"se na funkce :func:`math.floor` a :func:`math.ceil` pro alternativní "
"konverze."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:355
msgid ""
"float also accepts the strings \"nan\" and \"inf\" with an optional prefix "
"\"+\" or \"-\" for Not a Number (NaN) and positive or negative infinity."
msgstr ""
"float také prijima retezce \"nan\" a \"inf\" s volitelnou predponou \"+\" "
"nebo \"-\" pro Not a Number (NaN) a kladne nebo záporné nekonecno."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:359
msgid ""
"Python defines ``pow(0, 0)`` and ``0 ** 0`` to be ``1``, as is common for "
"programming languages."
msgstr ""
"Python definuje ``pow(0, 0)`` a ``0 ** 0`` jako ``1``, jak je obvykle v "
"programovacích jazycích."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:363
msgid ""
"The numeric literals accepted include the digits ``0`` to ``9`` or any "
