#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:399
msgid "Bitwise Operations on Integer Types"
msgstr "Bitove operace na celostech typech"

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:413
msgid ""
"Bitwise operations only make sense for integers. The result of bitwise "
"operations is calculated as though carried out in two's complement with an "
"infinite number of sign bits."
msgstr ""
"Bitove operace mají smysl pouze pro cela cisla. Výsledek bitovych operací je"
" vypocitan jako by byl proveden v dvojslenrovne komplemensu s nekonecnym "
"poctem znamenkovych bitu."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:417
msgid ""
"The priorities of the binary bitwise operations are all lower than the "
"numeric operations and higher than the comparisons; the unary operation "
"``~`` has the same priority as the other unary numeric operations (``+`` and"
" ``-``)."
msgstr ""
"Priority binárních bitovych operací jsou vsechny nižsí neZ numericke operace"
" a vyssí neZ porovnávání; unarni operace ``~`` má stejnou prioritu jako "
"dalsí unarní numericke operace (``+`` a ``-``)."

#: ../../library/stdtypes.rst:421
